{"parse": {"title": "CO-10", "pageid": 100915, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/CO-09\" title=\"CO-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">CO-10</span><a href=\"/wiki/CO-11\" title=\"CO-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">CO</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.86.BB.E9.9B.A8.E5.A4.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"冻雨天\">冻雨天</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 冻雨天</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Freezing Rain</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>您<span class=\"color-value\"></span>怎<span class=\"color-value\"></span>么<span class=\"color-value\"></span>能<span class=\"color-value\"></span>寄<span class=\"color-value\"></span>望<span class=\"color-value\"></span>温<span class=\"color-value\"></span>室<span class=\"color-value\"></span>里<span class=\"color-value\"></span>便<span class=\"color-value\"></span>能<span class=\"color-value\"></span>落<span class=\"color-value\"></span>下<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>场<span class=\"color-value\"></span>温<span class=\"color-value\"></span>热<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>呢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2710110</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">1987 普列谢茨克分部<br />暴雨前两个月</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">指针。拉普拉斯科算中心普列谢茨克分部研究员。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">加入计划的原因，和退出的原因一样。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:105%\">没有什么比眼前的生命重要。我一直是为了人们能活得更好而做研究。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lapulasidatang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lapulasidatang\"><img alt=\"lapulasidatang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-lapulasidatang.png/600px-Cg-lapulasidatang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-lapulasidatang.png/900px-Cg-lapulasidatang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-lapulasidatang.png/1200px-Cg-lapulasidatang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你在这儿，指针！最近怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>理线学学者似乎并不介意她的中途离场。每当在分部大楼碰见指针，她都会聊上几句，顺带提及一些航天小组的近况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我听说你正忙着帮相关人员撤离。情况如何？我看米尔内大部分的店铺都关门了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>老样子。等之前的工作交接完了，我就会到米尔内镇上正式开始协助，应该也就是帮忙打包、协调人员、解释情况之类的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我昨天问起冷周六研究情况，她也说是“老样子”。但我看他们进度还不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>是吗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌从大衣里取出一个小袋子，把话题轻巧地拨向了其他方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>噢，我刚想起来——这里还有点多出来的种子。这次多给你些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-632913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-632913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-632913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>……我看起来对园艺感兴趣？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>米尔内的驻军和一些民众说，之前有拉普拉斯的研究员给他们送过向日葵种子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我只知道这个人不是我自己，但具体是哪位，也没有什么证据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你不需要吗？我看他们很喜欢这份礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在离开普列谢茨克发射基地的那天，她将花种分发给了沿途碰到的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当时她是怎么想的？或许是急切地想抛开任何联系，避免自己中途折返。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她收起了这份礼物，打算在合适的时机再次送出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>多谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>说起来，那份延迟撤离申请书，最后是谁提交给路德维希的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>冷周六打算在取监测器的时候顺带提交，正好展示她的研究成果。她说这样路德维希同意的概率会大很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>他们是彻底不打算中止计划了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我想他们不会放弃的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shuixiamaopao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shuixiamaopao\"><img alt=\"shuixiamaopao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/600px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/900px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/1200px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>还是放弃吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>那些鱼稍稍受了点刺激就不吃东西，你怎么喂也没用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我明白了，冷周六女士。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她依然在将鱼食仔细地撒上水面，希望这些脆弱的小生物能多少保留些求生意志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>我刚清点完了剩余的材料，卢恩矿石的损耗比预想中好一些。<br />剩下的文件要放到哪里？反面还能当计算稿纸用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>如果你能帮我把这些文件变成一把刀，我会很感激你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>虽然派不上大用场，至少它们还能拿来切切水果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>这个不行。你桌上废弃的名片可以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>有什么特别的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>材质。金属名片不算常见，它们做武器会比用于自我介绍更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>那是我之前研制的新型材料。北方哨歌和指针的名片也都是我做的，受热就会变锋利，在手里捏一会儿能当拆信刀用……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话音在这里停住了。他们尽量不提及指针的离开，试图让一切按照寻常的模样继续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这个术式不够稳定……要想预设目的地，必须锚定一片区域，或是一个明确的定位点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>得先确定它能识别的范围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>公式是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-311813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-311813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-311813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>北方哨歌女士发了条消息提醒我们记得取监测器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>噢，她给大伙儿都发了？替我谢谢她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>不对……不是这个数。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633315.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-633315.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633315.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633315.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-633315.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633315.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-633315.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633315.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">含章鼎：</div><div>我尽可能打听过了，你说的神秘学矿物有好几种都相当稀缺，现在没法弄到手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>也行，能弄到更好，没有就算了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>是这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-311610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>不，完全不对劲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/HeadIconSmall-311612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>计算数据本来是指针拿手的活儿，如果她来算会快很多……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房间角落的声音引着她回过头，远旅正用几块矿石碎屑搭起摇摇晃晃的尖塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在灯光照耀下，塔尖闪闪发亮，格外引人注目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>当心别划伤自己了，那些东西看起来没用，但实际威力大得很。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看见远旅半知半解地点点头，冷周六回过头来，打算重新想办法对付手里的数据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但微妙的平静一旦被打破，就很难再恢复原状。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>冷周六女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>照顾完那些鱼，小宇航员走到了冷周六的旁边。她难得主动靠得这么近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我想询问您一个问题……时机也许不太合适。但是它对我非常重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我希望您能给我确定的、真实的答复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金鱼缸成为了这个突兀话题的无辜受害者。基金会职员慌张地捞起地板上的鱼，为它在旁边找了个新的住处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>抱歉——冷周六女士，您可以当我不在这儿。我并不知道你们有过什么谈话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>库珀花环小姐很聪明，她猜出任何事都不奇怪，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六俯视着她，这张仰起的脸很稚嫩，但神情也很坚决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你的问题是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>指针女士离开的时候提到过，“那些消失的城市和人，我们都见过太多了”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我想，指针女士不是会轻易放弃的人。除非她知道，我们失败的后果远超能够承受的范围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>“暴雨”不只是一场自然灾害，是不是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>“暴雨”是不是会让我们现在生活的地方也消失……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抛出了自己压在心底许久的疑惑，冷周六看见她的眼睛像漂亮的玻璃弹珠那样蓄满了光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不知该如何回答，但沉默本身也是一种答案。于是女孩明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我们认识的人也会吗？小熊、鸟儿、这些鱼也都会，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>在我们找回那个失去的“未来”之前，也要面对很多次……很多次的……消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>它……没有你们描述得那么好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>有多少东西改变了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩眼中的那些光始终没有真正地淌下来。库珀花环很早就明白眼泪的作用相当有限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>太多东西都不如人们想象的长久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>对你们来说或许是天翻地覆的改变，但生活还在继续。有好事，也有坏事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>麻烦总是接踵而至，指针离开，北方哨歌还有自己的地质勘察任务，而这里正在说话的人都在向她寻求回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六尝试斟酌措辞，但她本就没有太多被关照的经验，并不理解要如何安慰他人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>所以——你决定好要正式加入拉普拉斯了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>只有正式员工才有知情权。在此之前我无法向你透露太多东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>抱歉，冷周六女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>考虑到库珀花环小姐要执行的任务，她有权知道“暴雨”意味着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我明白，您不想违反拉普拉斯的规定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>但我想您可以点头或摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六点头了。于是库珀花环继续说下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我不会在未来见到科兹洛夫先生，也不会得到那份礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>加入拉普拉斯，意味着……我要和乌特恩亚亚的大家彻底告别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默片刻后，她再次点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你可以做选择，像指针那样，我不会强迫你留下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>在餐馆碰到你那天，我说可以给你写推荐信，和今天一样都是认真说的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>推荐信我其实已经写好了，以防万一，你后面那位灰白格子也会给你担保证明，北方哨歌也在推荐信上签了名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你的朋友远旅也会得到推荐。但我们终究没法为所有人解决问题，也没法替任何人做决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你要继续吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她也在问自己同样的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>还要继续吗？如果拿回数据，如果数据有用，是不是总有一天所有人都不用再受“暴雨”的困扰？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如果努力拿回的数据只是一堆无用的字符呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>不做尝试就只能被迫接受，试一试至少还有机会改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是她的答案。也只是她自己的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "CO-10"}}